# Backend

- Mount routers in `src/index.js`. Use `asyncHandler` + `AppError`.
- SQL: `$1`, `$2` only. Schema changes go in `src/db/migrations/`. Baseline is `migrate.js`.
- JWT: `jwt.sign({ id, email }, JWT_SECRET)`. Access ~1h, refresh 7d in `refresh_tokens`.
- `/ai/*` proxies Ollama (`OLLAMA_URL`). Do not require JWT unless adding a product auth path.

```javascript
router.post('/', authenticateToken, requireBoardEdit, asyncHandler(async (req, res) => {
  const result = await pool.query('SELECT * FROM boards WHERE id = $1', [req.body.boardId]);
  if (!result.rows[0]) throw new AppError('Board not found', 404, 'BOARD_NOT_FOUND');
  res.status(201).json(result.rows[0]);
}));
```
